   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这个场景最妙的地方是<strong>考题可以自造</strong>：在完好曲线上按真实损伤类型挖空，真值在手，重建误差立刻可以量化——不需要额外标注。人工要做的只是把历史上确认过的异常段整理成清单，用来校准检测阈值。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>多曲线测井数据</span><span class='cl-s'>全井段，GR/DEN/RT 等逐深度对齐</span></span><span class='cl-n'>人工标记的异常段清单</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>邻井同期曲线</span><span class='cl-s'>同区块 20 口以上，层位可对比</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为长缺失段的参照</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井径与工程记录</span><span class='cl-s'>遇卡、掉电、扩径等井况事件</span></span><span class='cl-n'>辅助判断异常原因与可信度</span></div></div>"
